  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper proposes a VQE + SWAP‑Test quantum classifier for credit sales risk using amplitude‑encoded data. Experiments on a dataset of 40 samples using a 9‑qubit simulated circuit (3 feature qubits) achieve up to 100% training accuracy after ansatz and threshold tuning, comparable to classical models such as SVM and Random Forest that also reach 100% accuracy. All experiments are performed via classical simulation rather than quantum hardware.",
  "experiments": [
